          "book": "DAN",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Daniel spoke and said, “I saw in my vision by night, and, behold, the four winds of the sky broke out on the great sea.",
      "ko": "다니엘이 진술하여 가로되 내가 밤에 이상을 보았는데 하늘의 네 바람이 큰 바다로 몰려 불더니",
      "source_text_hash": "4f754e1b245dc47112bd80b31cc9eec914b64e4d62cd1edee7a45a22c0185d5f",
      "translation_text_hash": "b7512755d1c3a6f1d0fa3a7aef0a69e312cfa11a1f247006de6e0b5ff759b8e3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
