      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DAN",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "As for the rest of the animals, their dominion was taken away; yet their lives were prolonged for a season and a time.",
      "ko": "그 남은 모든 짐승은 그 권세를 빼았겼으나 그 생명은 보존되어 정한 시기가 이르기를 기다리게 되었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "abdff77bd6a20b0b565cd95a121cbdb1532c2fa59fab0991d0f74fb0f1861c61",
      "translation_text_hash": "df7676e56d7ca88457aaabf2a4a7f317b57e1a6637ce383f0ecd18f5d81649fe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
