      "en": "“Then I desired to know the truth concerning the fourth animal, which was different from all of them, exceedingly terrible, whose teeth were of iron, and its nails of bronze; which devoured, broke in pieces, and stamped the residue with its feet;",
      "ko": "이에 내가 네째 짐승의 진상을 알고자 하였으니 곧 그것은 모든 짐승과 달라서 심히 무섭고 그 이는 철이요 그 발톱은 놋이며 먹고 부숴뜨리고 나머지는 발로 밟았으며",
      "source_text_hash": "bba4df757a6a207b372887a23826c5842fdc6d48242506fb182f5544f428903d",
      "translation_text_hash": "455c1ee88d2476b2ea9b830e56abda08b93713a93b8ea844a08152dba2077cff",
